$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM The mixture of p-tosylhydrazones (373 mg, 0.79 mmol) was dissolved in
DMF-sulfolane (1:1; 10 mL), and NaBH3CN (200 mg, 3.2 mmol) and PTSA (42
mg, 0.22 mmol) were added. The mixture was heated at 140 °C for 6 h, then
cooled to r.t. and dissolved in EtOAc (20 mL). The organic phase was
washed with H2O (3 × 20 mL) and brine (3 × 20 mL), then the organic layer
was dried over Na2SO4, filtered and evaporated. The crude material was
purified by flash chromatography (EtOAc-hexane, 2%).
(4aR,6R,8aS)-2,2-Di-tert-butyl-6-methylhexahydropyrano[3,2-d][1,3,2]dioxasiline
(7). Yield: 141 mg (62%); colourless liquid. Rf = 0.68 (EtOAc-hexane,
30%); [α]D24 +10.4 (c 0.58, CHCl3). IR (NaCl): 2966, 2935, 2881, 2860
cm-1. 1H NMR (CDCl3): δ = 4.12 (q, J= 6.5 Hz, 1 H, CH-8), 3.99 (dd, J=
9.8, 4.5 Hz, 1 H, CH2-5), 3.77 (t, J= 9.8 Hz, 1 H, CH2-5), 3.71 (m, 1 H,
CH-1), 3.56 (td, J= 9.5, 4.7 Hz, 1 H, CH-6), 1.93 (m, 2 H, CH2-9), 1.62
(m, 2 H, CH2-10), 1.29 (d, J= 6.3 Hz, 3 H, CH3-8), 1.04 [s, 9 H,
C(CH3)3], 1.00 [s, 9 H, C(CH3)3]. 13C NMR (CDCl3): δ = 74.72 (CH-6),
69.57 (CH-1), 68.72 (CH-8), 67.80 (CH2-5), 28.97 (CH2-9), 27.50
[C(CH3)3], 27.40 (CH2-10), 27.13 [C(CH3)3], 22.65 [C(CH3)3], 19.92
[C(CH3)3], 16.49 (CH3-8). MS (ESI): m/z (%) = 285 (68), 286 (22) [M]+,
287 (39), 307 (100), 309 (58) [M + Na]+. HRMS (ESI): m/z calcd for
C15H31O3Si: 287.1964; found: 287.2037.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Wolff-Kishner reaction, overall yield 47% from ketone derivative
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
